// Before confirming a selection, window detection follows pointer movement
// across frozen top-level windows, including primary/secondary taskbars.
// Opening window capture only previews the initial target; click or drag locks
// the selection. Taskbar buttons/child controls remain a later enhancement.
// Ordinary pointer movement (without pressing a button) must update the preview.
